{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53283","headline":"诗偈 一○八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 一○八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不用苦多闻，看他彼上人。\n百忆及日用，元在一毛尘（《宗镜录》卷十八作「纂在一毛鳞」）。\n心但寂无相，即出无明津。\n若能如是学，几许省精神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}